{{also|peru|Perú|Perù|Perû|Perũ|Perū|perü|pēru}}
==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|es|Perú}}, possibly from the personal name {{m|und|Birú}}, or from the {{der|en|qu|pelu||river}}. More likely from the ''[[w:Virú Valley|Virú Valley]]'', site of an ancient culture. ''Virú'' (or ''[https://glosbe.com/quz/en/wiru wiru]'' is said by [[W:Nils Holmer| Holmer]] to mean ''[https://www.pueblos-originarios.ucb.edu.bo/digital/106001785.pdf bamboo].

